Description: OSU Micro-Benchmarks (intel + openmpi5, OpenHPC)
 The OSU Micro-Benchmarks (OMB) are a widely used suite of benchmarks for
 measuring and evaluating the performance of MPI operations.
 Built with the intel compiler family and openmpi5 MPI stack.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
